                                                "sense_id": "608a6d92-8663-32bb-a50c-b969ecd67c03",
                                                "text": "And then he walked, with his gleaming gloves either side of his greenish-black frock coat, carefully placing one foot in front of the other to protect his brilliant top boots from the dust on the road, along the straight avenue that led up to the palace of Schönbrunn."
                                            }
